  "notes": [
    "Failed required HLS playlists are now excluded for the current lookup, including native status-zero failures and HTTP 5xx. No production DNS service, CDN rewrite, retry loop or video probe was added.",
    "Jujutsu S1E20 returns VOE VF alternatives (HLS and direct MP4); the old MULTI source is unavailable upstream. All returned backup samples passed on both fresh runtime rechecks.",
    "One initial mobile VOE HLS segment sample returned 403. The same signed stream later returned 206/200 for repeated range/plain samples, and fresh TV/mobile lookups passed. Initial failure evidence remains retained; the intermittent denial cause is unproven.",
    "Dark Knight primary and Frembed recovery returned the same unavailable HLS family with HTTP 404; Cpasmal exposed no backup entries. These two empty-case failures are retained, not claimed as successful playback.",
    "Matrix, Fight Club and Office passed on both wrappers with the ordinary two-request path. The focused maintenance audit still reports attention for observed dead/gated upstream candidates although returned Jujutsu backup media passed."
  ]
